> Cost, ownership and interpretation

Actual word work is O(5+corrections), with constant ordinary driver storage. The
optional trace owns both original operands, the five actual reciprocal records
when used and every successful or unsuccessful exact correction comparison. Its
logical policy counts10 fixed scalar slots plus actual update/comparison
records, default1000000 and zero disabling. Admission is online before each
recorded step/comparison; a quota failure returns no partial history. Exact
formatting and rounded plot conversion are outside those selected counters.

The reciprocal update’s algebra explains an approximation mechanism, while exact
inequalities establish the integer answer. The preserved educational half-seed
example and the actual operative1/d seed now have distinct roles, and the
complete-width checks make the returned result meaningful at both ends of the
uint64 domain without assuming a particular hardware divider implementation.

